03:18:34 SQL> -- Description:
03:18:34 SQL> --   Purges PS_* history rows matched via PSARCH tables within a date window.
03:18:34 SQL> --   TEST MODE: Uses ROLLBACK in place of COMMIT (see inline comments).
03:18:34 SQL> -- **********************************************************************
03:18:34 SQL> -- Note: RUN AS SYSADM
03:18:34 SQL> -- *******************************************************************************
