03:18:34 SQL> -- 12/25/2025    Anandmohan Singh  Reformatted purge script into SQL*Plus style;
03:18:34 SQL> --					       kept ROLLBACKs for testing with commit markers.
03:18:34 SQL> -- *******************************************************************************
